Description: Lessan AI — The Ultimate Cross-Platform Personal AI Assistant
 A real-time voice AI that can hear, see, understand, and control your
 computer. Runs locally, uses free Gemini + OpenRouter API tiers.
 .
 Kali/Linux packaging of the Lessan AI assistant with a system venv,
 Playwright Chromium, app-menu launcher and first-run data migration.
